1
00:00:00,035 --> 00:00:03,935
(Dr Lorvis:)Uh, I'm being implacable
and relentless.

2
00:00:03,939 --> 00:00:07,779
(Amy:)Isn't she lucky?

3
00:00:07,776 --> 00:00:09,906
(Dr Lorvis:)She keeps sending me
mixed signals.

4
00:00:09,912 --> 00:00:12,082
But I-I think we both
want the same thing.

5
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,450
(Amy:)What's that?

6
00:00:13,448 --> 00:00:16,288
(Dr Lorvis:)Unconditional love.

7
00:00:16,285 --> 00:00:17,955
(Amy:)I guess that's
all anybody wants.

8
00:00:17,953 --> 00:00:19,623
(Dr Lorvis:)I guess so.

9
00:00:19,621 --> 00:00:22,761
(Amy:)Well, I hope you get it.

10
00:00:22,758 --> 00:00:25,158
(Man:)One Mississippi,
two Mississippi.

11
00:00:33,068 --> 00:00:35,038
(Leonard:)Next game,
let's switch helmets.

12
00:00:35,037 --> 00:00:38,037
(Sheldon:)No, I'd look silly
in that helmet.

13
00:00:42,744 --> 00:00:44,574
I-I can't take these.

14
00:00:44,579 --> 00:00:46,609
Well, why not?

15
00:00:46,615 --> 00:00:47,945
(Dr Lorvis:)I mean, you want what I want.

16
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:51,020
(Dr Lorvis:)And we had
two wonderful Mississippis.

17
00:00:52,988 --> 00:00:55,118
(Amy:)But what about
the other girl?

18
00:00:55,123 --> 00:00:56,953
(Dr Lorvis:)Oh, right.
(stammers)

19
00:00:56,959 --> 00:00:57,959
(Dr Lorvis:)I'll tell her

20
00:00:57,960 --> 00:01:05,020
(Dr Lorvis:)we should just be friends.

